id: pm-rust-linked-note-diagnostics
title: Align linked note-option scope and diagnostic guidance
description: "Synthetic pm-cli 2026.11.18 comparisons exposed pre-existing differences. Native docs accepts --append-stable while the published command declares it on files only. Invalid --note-conflict values and missing add inputs share exit codes and refusal codes, but native omits some published usage guidance. Round CE covers the shared no-write behavior."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 3
tags[3]: collections,follow-up,oracle
created_at: "2026-11-18T13:06:06.143Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-18T18:27:00.929Z"
assignee: codex-sol
claim_principal: codex-sol
author: codex-sol
parent: pm-rust-oracle-1118
comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-18T16:39:36.360Z",codex-sol,Reviewing the assigned PR 181 findings against native behavior and the pinned oracle. Regression tests and gate results will be linked here.
  "2026-11-18T16:52:17.841Z",codex-sol,PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs65CD8K - Retained oracle parity. Published 2026.11.18 files with --note-conflict append and no addition returns missing_required_argument and explicitly names --add or --add-glob in detail and required.
  "2026-11-18T17:12:53.852Z",codex-sol,PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs65CD8U - 34d1ea82c7af. Both note-repair commands preserve an explicit timestamp. The append/replace regression also checks omission of an unspecified time.
  "2026-11-18T17:12:57.626Z",codex-sol,PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs65CD8d - 34d1ea82c7af. Detected identity remains detected on replay. The strict-ownership CLI test executes the offered retry and reads its persisted note.
  "2026-11-18T17:13:00.223Z",codex-sol,PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs65CD8y - 34d1ea82c7af. Omission receipts return a scoped collection read. The replay regression verifies the remaining test and identical item/history bytes.
  "2026-11-18T17:13:12.306Z",codex-sol,PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs65CD9S - 34d1ea82c7af. Collection reads bypass mutation identity resolution. A legacy credential-bearing default permits a read and refuses the subsequent write.
  "2026-11-18T18:09:25.822Z",codex-sol,"Verified append and replace retry flags, strict detected-session replay, and the read-only omission command. The linked-note and collection differential cases passed on pm-cli 2026.11.18."
  "2026-11-18T18:24:53.496Z",codex-sol,"The hosted cross-platform tests exposed canonical versus caller-spelled tracker roots. The repair will compare canonical directories, render portable relative selectors and check an absolute selector by filesystem identity before replay."
